  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/taint3/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 on dev 100b6fbb6e. _REGISTRATION_EVIDENCE_TYPES is still {callback_argument_reference}. Kotlin fixture: main reads System.getenv and calls register(::handle), handle runs ProcessBuilder(...).start(). The join is only references main->handle (callable_reference) and the claim reads inconclusive with 0 findings; the control handle(secret) reads violated. So the shape is inert today (step 1 of the item holds). Kotlin emission sites moved from kotlin.py:1764/:1807 to :2535/:2594. No kotlin A/B exists. MECHANISM: callable_reference absent from edge_types._REGISTRATION_EVIDENCE_TYPES, so a kotlin ::fn references edge is not walked by taint."  # 2772
