uted to the enclosing function, sink inside the referenced function,\n     `::fn` the only join. Include a control whose value comes from a RETURNING\n     source, so \"inside the callee\" and \"IS the callee\" are separable.\n  2. Check FIRST whether kotlin has the javascript defect at all: `::fn` may\n     resolve to a symbol the walk already reaches by a `calls` edge from\n     elsewhere, in which case there is nothing to fix and that is the answer.\n  3. An A/B on kotlin repositories, reporting findings ADDED, findings REMOVED\n     (the sanitizer surface), and precision READ AGAINST SOURCE on each added\n     finding -- not a count.\n\nALSO WORTH ENUMERATING, not assumed: whether any OTHER language emits a\nregistration-shaped `references` edge under a third evidence type. The\njavascript audit found four evidence types riding `references` in one analyzer\n(callback_argument_reference, ast_type_ref, object_field_reference, and an\nast_call_direct middleware chain), of which exactly one is a dispatch. Sweep\nevidence_types.py by mechanism rather than by name."  # 013e
